Portions of this project derived from the above:

  * Engines/PlaitsWavetables.cs — the wavetable generation functions for
    banks 0/4, 2/6 and 3/7 of the Wavetable engine are direct ports of the
    algorithms in `plaits/resources/wavetables.py`.

  * Resources/waves.bin — the original Plaits Braids-derived waveform data,
    redistributed unmodified.

  * The DSP architecture and engine designs throughout Engines/ are
    reimplementations of the original Plaits engine designs.

Pedal Plaits is an independent port and is not affiliated with, authorised by,
or endorsed by Mutable Instruments.
